      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a Hyderabad to Calicut luggage shift typically take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard hyderabad to calicut luggage shift covers roughly 850 km and usually takes 14‑18 hours of road travel, depending on traffic and weather. With Shree Ashirwad’s dedicated container trucks and real‑time GPS monitoring, most customers receive their belongings within 2‑3 business days, including loading and unloading.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are needed to shift household items by truck from Hyderabad to Calicut?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Customers must provide a valid ID proof, address proof at both origin and destination, a signed packing list, GST invoice for corporate moves, and the e‑Way bill generated for the cargo. If insurance is opted, the insurance declaration form is also required to activate the 100% coverage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my bike safe if I parcel it from Hyderabad to Calicut?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Shree Ashirwad uses dedicated two‑wheeler carriers equipped with wheel chocks and high‑tensile ratchet lashings. The bike is wrapped in bubble cushioning and secured on a hydraulic ramp, ensuring protection against vibrations and road shocks throughout the hyderabad to calicut luggage shift.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the IBA approval benefit my intercity move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">IBA approval means the mover adheres to banking and financial standards for transparency and accountability. For a hyderabad to calicut luggage shift, this simplifies claim processing for corporate reimbursements, ensures GST compliance, and guarantees that the mover follows a vetted code of conduct.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment live during the Hyderabad to Calicut transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Every container truck is fitted with satellite‑based GPS that provides real‑time location updates via a secure portal. Customers can monitor the progress of their hyderabad to calicut luggage shift, receive alerts at major checkpoints, and get estimated arrival times.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is included in the 7‑layer protective packaging system?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The system combines 80‑GSM heavy‑duty bubble wrap, high‑density foam edge protectors, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, stretch film weatherproofing, and custom wooden crates for fragile items. Each layer is designed to absorb shocks, prevent moisture, and guard against handling impacts during the hyderabad to calicut luggage shift.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the cost of a Hyderabad to Calicut luggage shift calculated?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is based on total volume (cubic feet), distance, type of vehicle (18ft, 22ft, or 32ft container), fuel surcharge, insurance premium, and any additional services such as packing or express delivery. The cost matrix displayed on the site breaks down each component for full transparency.</p>
